OL,3,GNEWSAHousing cited 'huge priority'
OL,4,Aahead of election
OL,5,
OL,6,FHousing pressures on the Isle of Man
OL,7,Fare mounting and are a "huge priority"
OL,8,Fin the lead up to the House of Keys
OL,9,Fgeneral election, a Douglas Councillor
OL,10,Fhas warned.
OL,12,FIt comes as the majority of the 82
OL,13,Fcandidates standing for a seat as an
OL,14,FMHK have cited housing a top priority
OL,15,Ffor them.
OL,17,FCouncillor Natalie Byron-Teare said the
OL,18,Fauthority was the island's largest
OL,19,Fsocial housing landlord, managing 2,400
OL,20,Fproperties with 250 currently on the
OL,21,Fwaiting list.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
